MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "That's Christmas To Me connects my earlier Christmas listening with the vocal harmonies I am interested in after The New Old Fashioned, making it the one album I would try today.",
    "Lead With Your Heart, It's Entertainment, and All That Echoes appeal to my interest in vocal performances, even though that interest alone is not enough for me to choose them today."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Precious Memories and Sunday Mornin Singin suggest hymns or gospel, while my past Christmas listening does not mean I am looking for religious music now.",
    "A movie soundtrack, comedy recording, and country retrospective do not offer the group vocal harmonies I want for this listening session."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My holiday listening seems to have been taken as a broader interest in hymns and gospel, although those serve a different listening mood for me.",
    "Recommending The Classic Christmas Album seems to lean too heavily on a familiar title; recognizing something I have played does not make it my next choice."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My most recent interest in The New Old Fashioned makes group vocal harmonies especially relevant to what I want now.",
    "I rarely choose something unless it feels particularly relevant, so several appealing vocal albums can still lead to just one choice: a fresh holiday album that also fits my interest in harmonies."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly understood my interest in Christmas music and vocal harmonies, but stretched it too far toward religious music and familiar titles."
}
